roblem 9 (page does not exist)\">Team 9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">Team 10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">Team 11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 12 (page does not exist)\">Team 12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 13 (page does not exist)\">Team 13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 14 (page does not exist)\">Team 14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 15 (page does not exist)\">Team 15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 16 (page does not exist)\">Team 16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 17 (page does not exist)\">Team 17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 18 (page does not exist)\">Team 18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_CTMC_P